---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../../../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout title="Product" lang="en" activePage="product" altLangHref="/product/">
  <div class="page-intro">
    <h1>Product</h1>
    <div class="intro-images">
      <img src="/images/image002-3.jpg" alt="Bakery machines" />
      <img src="/images/shutterstock_53299849.jpg" alt="Production lines" />
      <img src="/images/image005-1.jpg" alt="Bakery equipment" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-area">
    <main class="main-content entry anim-up">
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/en/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Product</span>
      </div>

      <h1>Automated production lines</h1>
      <h6 class="fancy-header">BAKERY MACHINERY AND PRODUCTION LINES FOR DOUGH, MIXERS AND OTHER BAKERY EQUIPMENT</h6>
      <p style="text-align:justify;">Quality does sell at all times and in all markets and regions. Traditional manufacturing adds just that little bit more, let's call it "the final touch". Customers are asking for a personal approach in product and presentation. In the Benelux we can state that the fees we pay employees are a determining factor for the market price of the final product. PINSO can help you making the right choice before purchasing a new installation.</p>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; margin:14px 0;">
        <img src="/images/image002-3.jpg" alt="Bakery machine" style="width:100%; border-radius:2px;" />
        <img src="/images/bakkerijproducten-netwerk.jpg" alt="Bakery production lines" style="width:100%; border-radius:2px;" />
      </div>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; margin:14px 0;">
        <div>
          <p style="text-align:justify;">Pinso operates in the sector of automated production lines for many years. We can help you to determine the objectives and then to buy the best equipment. After analysing the needs you have, we can make a first selection within the different suppliers. The final choice on the equipment to purchase is up to the customer to decide.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-weight:600; font-size:12px; margin-bottom:6px;">We have experience with the following products for dough make lines:</p>
          <ul class="fancy-list">
            <li>ADAMATIC</li><li>KORTLEVER</li><li>PAVAILLER</li><li>KALLMEIER</li>
            <li>DE KAAKGROEP</li><li>CAPWAY SYSTEMS</li><li>FORTUNA</li><li>DAUB</li>
            <li>HEUFT-BACKOFENBAU</li><li>BELSHAW</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px; margin-top:16px;">
        <div>
          <h1>Packaging &amp; Presentation</h1>
          <h6 class="fancy-header">HOW CAN I LAUNCH MY NEW PRODUCT SUCCESSFULLY IN A COMPETITIVE MARKET</h6>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; margin:10px 0; flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <img src="/images/shutterstock_53299849.jpg" alt="Packaging" class="shadow-img" style="width:120px; height:120px; object-fit:cover;" />
            <img src="/images/ovens-bakkerij.jpg" alt="Olive oil" class="shadow-img" style="width:120px; height:120px; object-fit:cover;" />
          </div>
          <p style="text-align:justify; font-size:12px;">How a new product is presented to potential customers is just partly the key to success. Pinso has extensive experience in the food business. A few years ago we successfully launched a new olive oil for supermarkets under the brand name Rozakis within OKAY, part of Colruyt supermarkets.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1>Ovens for the bakery</h1>
          <h6 class="fancy-header">BAKKERIJ OVENS IN DE UITVOERING VAN BANDOVENS, RACKOVENS EN NOG VELE ANDERE</h6>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; margin:10px 0; flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <img src="/images/bakkerij-ovens.jpg" alt="Heuft bakery oven" class="shadow-img" style="width:120px; height:120px; object-fit:cover;" />
            <img src="/images/bakkerijovens.jpg" alt="Bakery ovens" class="shadow-img" style="width:120px; height:120px; object-fit:cover;" />
          </div>
          <p style="text-align:justify; font-size:12px;">Whether we are talking about a craft bakery or an industrial bakery, bakery ovens form the key to success within your bakery. Pinso has the distribution rights for the thermal oil ovens <a href="http://www.kornfeil.com/" style="color:#2c5282;">KORNFEIL</a> within the Benelux. We also have extensive experience with BECKER and BONGARD ovens, REVENT rackovens, HEUFT and GPG ovens.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h1>Bake off ovens</h1>
      <h6 class="fancy-header">EUROFOURS, THE BEST BAKE OFF OVEN FOR BREAD AND PASTRY</h6>
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr; gap:16px; margin:10px 0;">
        <div>
          <p style="text-align:justify;">Shops where you can buy sandwiches, croissanteries, delicatessen and breadpoints (cold bakeries), are a booming business. After purchasing the right prebaked bakery products, the right choice of the bake off oven remains extremely important.</p>
          <p>Pinso is promoting <a href="http://www.eurofours.com/" style="color:#2c5282;">EUROFOURS</a> bake off ovens for the bakery and breadpoints. We also have extensive experience with BONGARD, PAVAILLER, Leventi, WIESHEU and MIWE.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/images/oven-bakkerij1.jpg" alt="Bake off oven" class="shadow-img" style="width:100%; border-radius:2px;" />
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h1>Production lines for donuts</h1>
      <div class="colored-box">
        <h6 style="font-family:'Philosopher',serif; font-size:12px; color:#1a365d; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px; margin:0 0 8px;">DONUTS MACHINES FOR THE REAL AMERICAN DOUGHNUTS</h6>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px;">
          <p style="text-align:justify; font-size:12px;">Convenience food, a frequent term within the market. Donuts after burgers are often seen as the king of fast food. Belshaw is known as one of the best suppliers of small to industrial "donuts" production lines.</p>
          <img src="/images/belshaw-afbakoven.jpg" alt="Belshaw donut machine" class="shadow-img" style="width:100%; border-radius:2px;" />
        </div>
        <blockquote style="margin-top:10px; padding:8px 14px; border-left:4px solid #2c5282; background:#fff; font-size:12px; font-style:italic;">
          <strong>Pinso</strong> helps you making the right choice both in composition of product as the choice of the most appropriate equipment for your production.
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h1>Baking Trays, Bread Pans, Combinations</h1>
      <h6 class="fancy-header">BAKING TRAYS, BREAD PANS AND COMBINATIONS WITH OR WITHOUT COATING</h6>
      <p style="text-align:justify;">Which baking tray or tin for which product? Do I choose for a coated pan or a perforated baking tray? This remains a delicate issue for many bakeries. After a detailed analysis of your production methodology we can provide you a customized proposal. House Supplier remains KEYBAKE. We also have experience with products EVERBAKE and CAPWAY.</p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h1>Rational use of energy</h1>
      <h6 class="fancy-header">ENERGY SAVING SYSTEMS IN THE BAKERY</h6>
      <p style="text-align:justify;">Cooling for bakery, bakery ovens, bakery machinery as well as your shop. Running a bakery requires a lot of energy. Pinso has years of experience to provide you the best possible advice in saving energy.</p>
    </main>

    <Sidebar lang="en" activePage="product" side="left" showLogo={true} />
  </div>
</Layout>
